# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-

"""
============================================================
MYX / MAYAX AI
CORE BRAIN
============================================================

Architecture:

User Input
    ↓
Input Understanding
    ↓
Memory Context
    ↓
Decision
    ├── Conversation
    │      ↓
    │   Conversation Response
    │
    └── Action
           ↓
       Global Action Pipeline
           ↓
       Discovery → Search → Resolve
           ↓
       Safety → Selection → Execution

Persistence:

Brain
    ↓
DatabaseManager
    ↓
SQLite
    ├── users
    ├── conversation_history
    ├── memory
    ├── settings
    └── sessions

Memory:

Brain
    ↓
MemoryManager
    ↓
MemoryContext
    ↓
Relevant persistent memory

Responsibilities:
    - receive user input
    - understand input
    - maintain user context
    - connect persistent database
    - connect persistent memory
    - build memory context
    - route conversation
    - route actions
    - preserve legacy router compatibility
    - persist conversation history
    - expose memory APIs
    - expose conversation history APIs

The Brain does NOT directly launch applications.

Gemini / external AI is intentionally NOT included yet.
============================================================
"""

